# Don't ignore the built wasm: it lives in web/ so the static site is
# self-contained when checked out. The build script regenerates it.
!web/omc.wasm

# The repo-root .gitignore ignores `*.mo` (for gettext translations).
# Our `.mo` files are Modelica source — track them.
!**/*.mo
